                          "content": "Note: While the new grid feature in Figma (since May 2025) is definitely cool, it has lots of bugs and it not as flexible as you might think. We recommend using ”pack horizontal” and “pack vertical” combined with auto layout traditional without grid to-do tables. Do yourself a big favor and tie these commands to shortcuts.",
